**依据 2 · 源码核查**：[packages/dsh-tongflow/src/activation.ts:98-120](https://github.com/tong-io/tongflow/blob/0087122f5900073dfbdb0e7a1e2ff497245e1f21/packages/dsh-tongflow/src/activation.ts#L98-L120)

